### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### Exercise 4 – Create tickets
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────


### Exercise 4 – Task 3: Create a valid ticket (should return 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cannot access email",
  "description": "User cannot login to company email account.",
  "category": "Email",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "createdBy": "amir@example.com"
}


### Exercise 4 – Task 3: Create an invalid ticket (should return 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "createdBy": ""
}


### Verify: Get all tickets after creating a new one
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
